Apriori algorithm
Once the frequent itemsets have been obtained, association rules can be generated:
For each frequent itemset l, generate all non-empty subsets of l
For every non-empty subset s of l, output the rule s → l-s
if the confidence > minconf
E.g., for frequent itemset I = {beer, babyfood, diapers}, generate:
{diapers, babyfood} => {beer}
{diapers, beer} => {babyfood}
{babyfood, beer} => {diapers}
{diapers} => {babyfood, beer}
{beer} => {diapers, babyfood}
{babyfood} => {beer, diapers}
And keep those with sufficient confidence (> minconf)
